# React / TypeScript UI

- Functional components only
- Prefer explicit props interfaces over `any`
- Handle loading and error states on data pages
- Prefer existing design tokens in `globals.css` (`--accent`, `--sidebar`, etc.)
- Reuse `Modal`, `ConfirmDeleteDialog`, `ColumnVisibilityMenu`, `EditMembersModal`, `PermissionModal`, `Breadcrumbs`, `AccessIconButton` / `AccessIconLink` before inventing new dialogs/nav
- Always confirm deletes with `ConfirmDeleteDialog` (never delete on first click)
- Admin/admin-group table viewers get column show/hide via `useColumnVisibility` + `ColumnVisibilityMenu`
- Table row actions use icons with tooltips (`AccessIconButton` / `AccessIconLink` from `TableActionIcon`) instead of text links

```tsx
// ✅ Typed API usage
const users = await apiGet<UserRecord[]>('/users');

// ❌ Untyped / silent failures
const users = await apiGet('/users');
```

- Clear `localStorage` auth keys on logout (`authToken`, `userUsername`)
- After login, redirect to `/` (not legacy `/dashboard`)
